{"nodes": [{"id": "_superpowers_sdd_task_k5_report_deflate_relay_coroutine", "label": "K5 Deflate Relay Coroutine (raw stream \u2192 pako.Inflate \u2192 bodyStream)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/task-K5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs concurrently with the body parser so deflate bodies parse incrementally: relay owns the raw compressed stream, pako.Inflate {raw:true, chunkSize:16384} feeds an inflated-space ReadBufferStream (bodyStream) that the body loop reads via the parameterized bsrc, keeping raw and inflated offset spaces strictly separated."}, {"id": "_superpowers_sdd_task_k5_report_normalizesyntax_deflate_bug", "label": "Root bug: _normalizeSyntax maps deflate TS to ELE (deflate detection never fired)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/task-K5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fix: keep rawTransferSyntaxUID (un-normalized 00020010 value) for deflate detection alongside the normalized transferSyntaxUID used for startDataSet/body parity."}, {"id": "_superpowers_sdd_task_k5_report_pako_chunksize_deadlock", "label": "Root bug: pako default chunkSize 65536 deadlocks streaming inflate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/task-K5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "onData only fires when the output buffer fills or at Z_STREAM_END; with a 64KB default buffer, partial input produced no inflated bytes while the tail gate was open. Fix: chunkSize 16384 so onData fires per 16KiB, bounding bodyStream at ~16KB + max element size."}, {"id": "src_eventstream_frompart10stream_frompart10stream", "label": "fromPart10Stream (chunked streaming bytes\u2192events source)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".superpowers/s